  "notes": [
    "Parity.cmd (sync script v4+) also installs Etto's local add-ons (HD Lighting dimming, lighter textures, ekgHUD patch) from EttosPlayhouse_LocalPack.zip, which Etto hands out personally. Put it next to Parity.cmd.",
    "ekgHUD users: the ekgHUD compatibility patch (so the server's survivor table shows up) comes in Etto's local pack; ask Etto for it.",
    "Big campaigns (e.g. Vltava, 813 MB): subscribe or sync with Left 4 Dead 2 CLOSED. The game downloads a Workshop item into one memory buffer the size of the whole file, so subscribing to a big one mid-game can crash it with OUT OF MEMORY."
  ],
